meta {
  name: Cancel contract
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/ops/contracts/{{contractId}}/cancel
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{opsToken}}
}

docs {
  Cancels a signed contract whose disbursement failed for good (the center closed, or its account cannot be fixed): the disbursement becomes `cancelled` and is never retried, the contract `cancelled` with `disbursement_failed`, and the student's application is withdrawn so they may apply again. 409 `disbursement_not_failed` while the disbursement is pending or sent, or once it settled; a contract already cancelled is answered as it is.

  On the demo contract it answers 409 once its disbursement settled.
}
